**Phase:** 7 — Settings, Profile & Security  
**Implementation:** Full-stack — Frontend + Backend + Database + Security + Testing  
**Design:** Premium white and pale-blue theme, blue primary actions, subtle borders, rounded cards, clean typography, and responsive layouts.

